<h1>Quartermaster</h1>
<div class="notice"><p><strong>Mostly not built.</strong> What exists: the <a href="/spec/quartermaster/">expense ledger format</a> and its <code>qm</code> validator, the <a href="/costs/#compare">cost comparison</a> tools, and a draft <a href="/treasury/">treasury journal</a> with a simulated example. There are no provider billing integrations, no hosted API and no dashboard; this site's cost figures are entered by hand. The rest of this page is the proposal, so people can shape it before more gets built.</p></div>
